# Cloudflare rewrite rules (#332): Workers static assets, also Pages and Netlify.
# Not served as a page.
# Every invite link https://tavlaki.com/i/<code> shows the fallback page
# i/index.html. The address stays the same (200 is a rewrite, not a
# redirect), so the friend still sees the code at the end of it.
# The target is /i/, not /i/index.html: Cloudflare serves index.html at its
# folder path, so /i/index.html would redirect to /i/ and loop.
# Never redirect /.well-known/apple-app-site-association: iOS refuses it.
/i/*  /i/  200
